# Project Architecture & Standards

All AI coding directives, architecture rules, and verification commands are defined in the canonical root reference:
See [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md).

## Key Principles:
- Strict TypeScript (`strict: true`, zero `any`).
- Always use `@fatturafacile/openapi-sdk` and `createErpClient()` from `@fatturafacile/shared` for ERP interactions.
- Every connector extends `BaseConnector` (`@fatturafacile/framework`) and has a root `manifest.json`.
- Verification: `pnpm typecheck`, `pnpm lint`, `pnpm test`.
